# Workspace rules for the Sysbuilder project.
#
# Codex `.rules` files are used for command approval and sandbox policy.
# Task-behavior instructions for this workspace live in `AGENTS.md`.
#
# This workspace requires reading `.codex/rules/Sysbuilder建模要求.md`
# before any Sysbuilder modeling action. That requirement is enforced via
# `AGENTS.md`.
#
# When running Python scripts for Sysbuilder modeling, Modelica generation,
# or report generation, scripts must be saved as UTF-8 and executed in UTF-8
# mode. Do not rely on inline terminal piping that can degrade Chinese names
# into `????` through the shell/stdin encoding chain.
